IOP modules for mmcefs
======================

mmcefs loads these into the IOP on its first mount if they are not already
running.  Install them on the PS2 root filesystem:

  mkdir -p /lib/modules/irx
  cp iomanX.irx fileXio.irx mmceman.irx /lib/modules/irx/

(or point the module parameter irx_dir= at another directory).

  file          source                                         sha256
